settings-live.patch (LUCY-wqn96 L4): route settings.json hook commands through the live export.

Apply ONLY after scripts/git-hooks/install.sh has run (run-gate must exist):
  patch -p1 -d ~/.claude < ~/.claude/scripts/git-hooks/settings-live.patch
Generated 2026-10-24T18:12Z against the LIVE ~/.claude/settings.json, which differs
from committed main (uncommitted edits by other sessions). Re-generate if it no longer applies.

- PreToolUse guards get --fail-exit 2: Claude Code blocks on exit 2 and only warns on any
  other code, so a drifted export must block, not wave the tool through.
- Left on the checkout path, because main has no committed copy to export (commit them first,
  then route them the same way): hooks/lucy-persona-sessionstart.sh (SessionStart),
  hooks/build-submit-guard.py (PreToolUse).
- skills/gstack/.../timeline-stop-hook is not a gate path and is unchanged.

